# Functional

1. User sign-up, sign-in, reset-password, edit profile.

2. Start group chats (limit 100 users)
3. Send-receive messages
4. Send/receive media
5. Access messages after they've been offline

6. Audio/Video calling.

# Non-Functional

1. Delivered with low-latency, < 500ms
2. Guarantee delivery of messages
3. Billions of users, high throughput
4. Messages not stored unnecessarily
5. Fault-tolerant

# Core entity

1. Users
2. Chats (2-100 users)
3. Messages
4. Clients (a user might have multiple devices)

# Commands

## Sent

- createChat
- sendMessage
- createAttachment
- modifyParticipants

## Received

- newMessage
- chatUpdate
